,"type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/contentMargins(_:_:for:)-1fs7f":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/contentmargins(_:_:for:)-1fs7f","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"contentMargins"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edge","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4EdgeO"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4EdgeO3SetV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EdgeInsets","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI10EdgeInsetsV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI22ContentMarginPlacementV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ContentMarginPlacement"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View"}],"abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/